Na kine ki riti thung syiem, shong dorbar said dorbar, Soso 
Tbain u la pynlong ka theme jong “Ka Meirilung’* : 

“Barob ki lang pyllun ka : 

Nangta ki nang ban saifi pyrthei : 

Kumta ki lab ban seng Hima 
Barob ki ieog ban da ia ka ; 

Kumta namar ki um ka snam, 

‘Ka im ka kyneng sab ka Nam. 

U Syiem kam pber la dei *u Maw*; 

Ka hima kit u Rit u Khraw; 

Bishar-khadar ryngkat bad ki, 

Ha u ki ai ka Nar bili : 

Te kum ki Tiew Myngor Lyngsyun, 

Kumta ka laid Dorbar pyllun. 

Lynti ka Duwar un bam ma u, 

Saikhum saiteh un bat ha u; 

Ka ^or u ioh ban ob kuna, 

Hynrei ha u kirn siew khajna; 

Barob ka ri rai ri-kynti;
